The files under src/sdl3/raw/ and the file src/sdl3/consts.clj are
generated by tools/gen.clj from the header files of Simple DirectMedia
Layer (SDL3), and reproduce its function signatures, type layouts,
enumeration names and values, and hint and property strings. SDL is:

  Simple DirectMedia Layer
  Copyright (C) 1997-2026 Sam Lantinga <slouken@libsdl.org>

and is distributed under the same zlib license as above; its notice is
in SDL_copying.h of the SDL source distribution. The generated files
are altered from the headers by construction and are marked as
generated at the top of each file.
